  "entries": {
    "cherry_adapt_summary": "将<scaleAD>额外攻击力</scaleAD>转化为<scaleAP>法术强度</scaleAP>。获得<scaleAP>@APAmp*100@%法术强度</scaleAP>。",
    "cherry_adapt_tooltip": "将<scaleAD>额外攻击力</scaleAD>转化为<scaleAP>法术强度</scaleAP>，并获得<scaleAP>@APAmpCalcTooltip@法术强度</scaleAP>。<br><br>当前转化：@f1@<br><br><rules>每点<scaleAD>攻击力</scaleAD>转化为<scaleAP>@ConversionRate@法术强度</scaleAP>。</rules>",
    "{1f7dc0a455}": "<scaleHealth>%i:scaleHealth%额外生命值</scaleHealth>转化为<br><scaleLethality>%i:scaleAPen%穿甲</scaleLethality>。<br><br>获得<scaleLethality>@Calc_BonusLethality@穿甲</scaleLethality>。",
    "{24b5d56143}": "<scaleHealth>%i:scaleHealth%额外生命值</scaleHealth>转化为<scaleLethality>%i:scaleAPen%穿甲</scaleLethality>。<br>(每<scaleHealth>@Calc_HPtoLethality@生命值</scaleHealth>转为<scaleLethality>@Calc_LethalitytoHP@穿甲</scaleLethality>)<br><br>获得<scaleLethality>@Calc_BonusLethality@穿甲</scaleLethality>。<br><br><rules>额外穿甲：@f1.1@</rules>",
    "{2593d74b83}": "来自你的装备的<scaleMana>%i:scaleMana%法力值</scaleMana>转化<br>为<scaleAP>%i:scaleAP%法术强度</scaleAP>。<br><br>使你的总<scaleAP>法术强度提升@APAmp*100@%</scaleAP>。",
    "{3b1fd50ef5}": "来自你的装备的<scaleMana>%i:scaleMana%法力值</scaleMana>转化为<scaleAP>%i:scaleAP%法术强度</scaleAP>。<br>(每<scaleMana>@Calc_ManaToAP@法力值</scaleMana>转为<scaleAP>@Calc_APPerMana@法术强度</scaleAP>)<br><br>使你的总<scaleAP>法术强度提升@APAmp*100@%</scaleAP>。<br><br><rules>额外法术强度：@f1.1@</rules>",
    "{32090728f2}": "<scaleAD>%i:scaleAD%攻击力</scaleAD>转化<br>为<attackSpeed>%i:scaleAS%攻击速度</attackSpeed>。<br><br>普攻附带<magicDamage>额外魔法伤害</magicDamage><OnHit>%i:OnHit%攻击特效</OnHit>。",
    "{19f6e3f250}": "<scaleAD>%i:scaleAD%攻击力</scaleAD>转化为<attackSpeed>%i:scaleAS%攻击速度</attackSpeed>。<br>(每<scaleAD>@Calc_ADtoAS@攻击力</scaleAD>转为<attackSpeed>@Calc_ASPerAD@攻击速度</attackSpeed>)<br><br>普攻附带<magicDamage>@Calc_OnHitDamage@额外魔法伤害</magicDamage><OnHit>%i:OnHit%攻击特效</OnHit>。<br><br><rules>额外攻击速度：@f1.1*100@%</rules>"
  }
}
